  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Alellia, who has had her engagement broken off, is past the marriageable age, and is known behind her back as the \"domineering female supervisor.\" She spends her days performing her duties as the right-hand woman of Marquess Istilia Wegmund, \"the cold-hearted prime minister.\"\n\nOne day, while performing her duties, the Prime Minister asks her to marry him.\n\nRumor has it that the Prime Minister is in love with another woman. Alellia accepts the engagement, believing that she is being asked to enter into a contractual marriage.\n\nA newly-married life with the cold-hearted prime minister begins...!"
  },
